{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"863508779407376404","content":"\"Yoohoo!\"","created_at":"2021-07-19T09:35:15.185000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"866614153829023794","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"863508779407376404","content":"While waiting, Irynx looks the nameless in the eye. \"Okay, listen, if there's shit between you both, I want it hashed out. I ran all over the city so you two could come back alive. You're both my friends. Get along.\"","created_at":"2021-07-19T09:37:19.929000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"866614677042757682","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"unashaminglyme","id":"340062533304057857","is_bot":0,"username":"unashaminglyme"},"author_id":"340062533304057857","channel_id":"863508779407376404","content":"\"Got it cap. Will fix things between us.\" The nameless nods vehemently.","created_at":"2021-07-19T09:38:09.757000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"866614886037585941","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"863508779407376404","content":"\"You think maybe she won't let us in because she heard the sound of your voice?\"","created_at":"2021-07-19T09:42:55.797000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"866616085776302090","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"unashaminglyme","id":"340062533304057857","is_bot":0,"username":"unashaminglyme"},"author_id":"340062533304057857","channel_id":"863508779407376404","content":"\"Could be a possibility...\" The nameless says as he inspects the airship for signs of Meorys. \"I'll wait here for her, she's gotta come out eventually. Or if she's not here, she'll come.\" He turns to Irynx. \"You can go ahead cap, I'll handle this by myself. You have some disciples to get.\"","created_at":"2021-07-19T09:56:19.645000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"866619457358921778","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"863508779407376404","content":"\"If you were serious about writing an article though... I wouldn't be against it.\"","created_at":"2021-07-19T09:58:40.662000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"866620048827351041","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"unashaminglyme","id":"340062533304057857","is_bot":0,"username":"unashaminglyme"},"author_id":"340062533304057857","channel_id":"863508779407376404","content":"\"Consider it done.\" The nameless lowers his head at Irynx. \"Any messages or statements from you? Also a topic you might suggest?\"","created_at":"2021-07-19T10:01:56.070000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"866620868427776000","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"863508779407376404","content":"\"I don't want it to be like, an ad placement. An opinion piece, maybe? About how much the ravens have done for the people of Empire City.\"","created_at":"2021-07-19T10:03:58.283000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"866621381024940042","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"unashaminglyme","id":"340062533304057857","is_bot":0,"username":"unashaminglyme"},"author_id":"340062533304057857","channel_id":"863508779407376404","content":"\"I don't plan on writing something as tacky as an ad. I also have my own thoughts about the ravens, about how they help in their own way. I can include direct quotes from you if you wanna hammer down your message.\"","created_at":"2021-07-19T10:05:48.399000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"866621842886492201","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"863508779407376404","content":"\"If you can remember anything I've said when we were at the cafe, I think I did a great job of selling them. But uh, for poetry's sake...\" Irynx clears her throat.\n\n\"Ravens are a symbol of loss and ill omen. That is, loss of fear, pain and trauma. Don't think about what you can gain from ravens,\" she gives the nameless a pointed look. \"But what you wish to let go.\"","created_at":"2021-07-19T10:19:24.193000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"866625264574267403","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"unashaminglyme","id":"340062533304057857","is_bot":0,"username":"unashaminglyme"},"author_id":"340062533304057857","channel_id":"863508779407376404","content":"The nameless repeaths this at Irynx. \"Got it. Keep reading the post and you might see it come up.\"","created_at":"2021-07-19T10:20:32.314000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"866625550294450176","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"863508779407376404","content":"\"So, not to be the negative here but, she's not opening the door.\"","created_at":"2021-07-19T12:02:39.007000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"866651247506358312","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
